  "description": "Seo Do-Gyeom, the young master of a mansion, and Yoon Seo-Won, the housekeeper's son, share a secret bond despite their different social statuses. After a kiss, Seo-Won falls in love, but Do-Gyeom abruptly leaves to study abroad. Five years later, Seo-Won, now an adult, is about to leave the mansion when Do-Gyeom returns and offers him a role as his pheromone partner.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
